      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The environmental and geological summaries are quite thorough, but I've flagged a few areas that warrant a deeper dive before any final decision. Specifically, the report mentions some localized subterranean instability near the proposed northern pier, which requires a more aggressive mitigation strategy than currently outlined. Furthermore, the long-term hydrological modeling suggests a higher-than-anticipated risk from seasonal high tides, which could impact the foundation integrity over the next few decades. We should absolutely commission an independent geotechnical review to address these potential vulnerabilities.",
